{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MFkHiWB3cVfnCAYfhPqGak","type":"tool_result","content":"93\tPackageBuildInfo Facade\n94\t-----------------------\n95\t\n96\t``PackageBuildInfo`` is the single interface the build pipeline uses to\n97\tquery all package configuration.  It wraps a ``PackageSettings`` and\n98\tadds variant awareness, patch discovery, and template resolution.\n99\t\n100\t.. list-table::\n101\t   :header-rows: 1\n102\t   :widths: 25 75\n103\t\n104\t   * - Category\n105\t     - What it provides\n106\t   * - **Identity**\n107\t     - Package name, variant, whether a config file exists, override\n108\t       plugin module\n109\t   * - **Resolution**\n110\t     - Sdist server URL, include wheels/sdists flags, platform\n111\t       filtering, per-package cooldown override\n112\t   * - **Build config**\n113\t     - Environment variables, parallel jobs, exclusive build flag,\n114\t       PEP 517 config settings, build directory\n115\t   * - **Source**\n116\t     - Download URL and filename templates with ``${version}``\n117\t       substitution, git submodule options\n118\t   * - **Patches**\n119\t     - Merged list of unversioned + version-specific + variant-specific\n120\t       patch files, sorted by filename\n121\t   * - **Metadata**\n122\t     - Build tag (from changelog length), annotations, PURL config,\n123\t       pyproject.toml overrides\n124\t\n125\tSee :doc:`/reference/config-reference` for the full field reference.\n126\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6fac9b73-0840-4e44-9d9d-233a82866e2f","uuid":"04d11ab0-fcea-45dc-aeb9-f98a9a6ca2d2","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:20:58.804Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/alustosa/git/model-routing-eval/.work/agent-eval/2026-10-09-claude-haiku-5-5-effort-medium/cases/r05_fromager_version_prebuilt/docs/concepts/package-settings.rst","content":"PackageBuildInfo Facade\n-----------------------\n\n``PackageBuildInfo`` is the single interface the build pipeline uses to\nquery all package configuration.  It wraps a ``PackageSettings`` and\nadds variant awareness, patch discovery, and template resolution.\n\n.. list-table::\n   :header-rows: 1\n   :widths: 25 75\n\n   * - Category\n     - What it provides\n   * - **Identity**\n     - Package name, variant, whether a config file exists, override\n       plugin module\n   * - **Resolution**\n     - Sdist server URL, include wheels/sdists flags, platform\n       filtering, per-package cooldown override\n   * - **Build config**\n     - Environment variables, parallel jobs, exclusive build flag,\n       PEP 517 config settings, build directory\n   * - **Source**\n     - Download URL and filename templates with ``${version}``\n       substitution, git submodule options\n   * - **Patches**\n     - Merged list of unversioned + version-specific + variant-specific\n       patch files, sorted by filename\n   * - **Metadata**\n     - Build tag (from changelog length), annotations, PURL config,\n       pyproject.toml overrides\n\nSee :doc:`/reference/config-reference` for the full field reference.\n","numLines":34,"startLine":93,"totalLines":126}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MFkHiWB3cVfnCAYfhPqGak","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
